# Parallels

> Parallels is a global leader in cross-platform solutions, enabling businesses and individuals to run Windows on Mac, deliver virtual applications and desktops, and access resources on any device. A subsidiary of Alludo (formerly Corel Corporation), Parallels serves millions of users and thousands of enterprises worldwide with virtualization, remote access, and Desktop-as-a-Service (DaaS) products.

## Core Products

- [Parallels Desktop for Mac](https://www.parallels.com/products/desktop/): Run Windows, Linux, and other operating systems on Mac without rebooting. The leading desktop virtualization solution for macOS, supporting Apple silicon and Intel Macs.
- [Parallels Desktop for Mac Enterprise Edition](https://www.parallels.com/products/desktop/enterprise/): Centralized management, mass deployment, and enterprise-grade security for running Windows on Mac fleets.
- [Parallels Desktop for Mac Business Edition](https://www.parallels.com/products/business/): Centralized virtualization management for Mac teams, with volume licensing and IT admin tools.
- [Parallels Remote Application Server (RAS)](https://www.parallels.com/products/ras/remote-application-server/): All-in-one virtual application and desktop delivery solution. Deploys on-premises, hybrid, or in the cloud (Azure Virtual Desktop, AWS, Google Cloud). Enables secure remote work from any device.
- [Parallels DaaS](https://www.parallels.com/products/daas/): Cloud-native Desktop-as-a-Service solution for delivering virtual apps and desktops from the cloud with simplified management.
- [Parallels Toolbox for Mac & Windows](https://www.parallels.com/products/toolbox/): Suite of lightweight productivity tools for everyday tasks — screenshots, video downloads, disk cleanup, and more.
- [Parallels Desktop for Chromebook Enterprise](https://www.parallels.com/products/desktop/chrome/support/): Run Windows applications on Chrome OS enterprise devices.

## Solutions

- [Enterprise Solutions](https://www.parallels.com/solutions/enterprise/): Workspace solutions for large organizations — virtual desktops, app delivery, and secure remote access customized to enterprise requirements.
- [Small Business Solutions](https://www.parallels.com/solutions/smb/): Flexible virtualization and remote access tailored for small and mid-size business teams.
- [Education Solutions](https://www.parallels.com/products/desktop/use-cases/education/): Parallels Desktop for students and academic institutions.
- [RAS Use Cases](https://www.parallels.com/products/ras/use-cases/): Remote work, VDI replacement, enterprise remote access, BYOD, and hybrid cloud scenarios.

